  "2026-11-20T06:28:54.469Z",codex-sol,Round ES will exercise both previously refused inputs on real trackers and record the results here.
  "2026-11-20T06:56:28.696Z",codex-sol,The native bulk preview identifies selected rows and preserves normal selection. Each changed memory gets one guarded SDK update with its own revision clock and cleared verification. The stdin adapter normalizes the native get document before applying the managed field changes. Focused real-tracker tests pass.
